  "pages": [
    {
      "page_idx": 28,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "header",
          "index": 0,
          "bbox": [
            0.358,
            0.056,
            0.649,
            0.073
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "第十章 蛋白质、核酸的定位与检测"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.83,
            0.058,
            0.864,
            0.072
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "187"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.1,
            0.896,
            0.145
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（四）用免疫印迹法分析蛋白质，用抗 His 抗体或者 StrepTactin HRP 结合物（化学发光方法）免疫检测蛋白"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.109,
            0.156,
            0.899,
            0.218
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "参照 Laemmli（1970）的方法，用 12.5% SDS-PAGE 分离蛋白质。在电泳后，聚丙烯酰胺胶中的蛋白质通过半干电转法转移到聚偏二氟乙烯（PVDF）膜上，并通过免疫检测进行分析。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.241,
            0.252,
            0.258
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. 溶液的配制"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.109,
            0.262,
            0.897,
            0.302
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（1）转移缓冲液:25mmol/L Tris 碱基、192mmol/L 甘氨酸、10%甲醇。配 1L，称 3.03g Tris 碱、14.4g 甘氨酸、100ml 甲醇，加蒸馏水到 1L。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.109,
            0.305,
            0.897,
            0.345
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2) PBST: 8.4mmol/L "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{Na_2HPO_4}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "、1.6mmol/L "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{KH_2PO_4}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "、150mmol/L NaCl、"
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "0.1\\%"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (V/V) 吐温-20，加蒸馏水到 1L。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.347,
            0.899,
            0.388
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（3）封闭液:PBST中 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "2\\%"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " （ "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\omega /V"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ）BSA。配 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "100\\mathrm{ml}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ，称2gBSA，加PBST到"
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "100\\mathrm{ml}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 。新鲜制备或在一 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "20^{\\circ}C"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 保存。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.39,
            0.901,
            0.431
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（4）二抗稀释缓冲液:PBST中 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "5\\%"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " （ "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\omega /V"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ）脱脂干牛奶（奶粉）。配 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "100\\mathrm{ml}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " ，称5g奶粉，用PBST加到 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "100\\mathrm{ml}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.433,
            0.192,
            0.45
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. 步骤"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.454,
            0.897,
            0.494
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（1）依照胶的大小，准备大小一样的膜一块以及 Whatman 3mm 层析纸 8 片。为了避免污染，均需要戴手套操作滤纸和膜。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.496,
            0.898,
            0.536
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（2）在 100% 甲醇（或乙醇）中浸湿 PVDF 膜 15s。把膜转化到一个蒸馏水（或者 Milli-QR）的容器中 2min。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.539,
            0.506,
            0.558
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(3) 在转移缓冲液中平衡膜至少 5min。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.56,
            0.438,
            0.579
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(4) 在转移缓冲液中浸润滤纸。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.582,
            0.438,
            0.6
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(5) 把胶浸润在转移缓冲液中。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.604,
            0.899,
            0.643
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(6) 在电泳板的正极中央放 4 层滤纸（正极，通常是红色），防止气泡的出现，把膜放在滤纸的上面。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.646,
            0.899,
            0.686
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(7) 把胶放在膜上面, 再在胶上放 4 层滤纸。在层叠的每一层轻轻地碾转巴斯德移液管可以移走气泡。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.688,
            0.735,
            0.708
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(8) 把负极连到上述组装好的转移叠垛上（负极，通常是黑色）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.71,
            0.899,
            0.75
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（9）把正负电极连接好后，调节电流、电压、转移时间。电流是由胶的大小决定的，推荐 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1\\mathrm{mA} / \\mathrm{cm}^2"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " （1h转化）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.754,
            0.901,
            0.835
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(10) 转移后, 标记膜的起始和预染色的蛋白质标准带的位置。可以用 Ponceau-S 红（可逆染色剂）染色从而检测转移效果。把膜在染色溶液（0.5%Ponceau S，1%烟酸）中培育，并温和搅拌 2min。印迹一般会在蒸馏水中或者在接下来的免疫检测步骤中脱色。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 20,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.838,
            0.9,
            0.899
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（11）室温下，在封闭液中浸润膜至少1h。如果用StrepTactin HRP结合物来检测，随后在含有 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "2\\mu \\mathrm{g / ml}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 抗生物蛋白的PBST预处理膜30min，以封闭生物素化的蛋白质。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 29,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 0,
          "bbox": [
            0.157,
            0.059,
            0.19,
            0.072
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "188"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "header",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.435,
            0.057,
            0.6,
            0.073
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "细胞生物学实验教程"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.124,
            0.093,
            0.911,
            0.176
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（12）室温下，与稀释到 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1:2000\\sim 1:1000"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 的一抗（penta-His抗体，Qiagen）或者稀释到 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1:4000"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 的StrepTactin HRP结合物一起在封闭缓冲液中培育 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1\\mathrm{h}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " （注意:不要用含有奶粉的稀释缓冲液来与抗His的抗体相互作用。这会降低灵敏度。也不要用奶粉来和StrepTactin HRP结合物相互作用，因为它含有大量交联的生物素）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.125,
            0.179,
            0.91,
            0.218
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（13）室温下，在 PBST 中洗涤膜 10min，重复 3 次。如果用 StrepTactin HRP 结合物时，直接跳到步骤（16）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.125,
            0.222,
            0.911,
            0.282
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（14）室温下，与二抗溶液一起培育 1h。碱性磷酸盐或者辣根过氧化物酶（HRP）结合物的鼠抗 IgG 都可以使用。来自 DAKO 兔抗鼠的 IgG/HRP 结合物有很好的效果。当用到化学发光的方法时，在 PBST 中用 5% 脱脂奶粉和二抗一起培育。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.167,
            0.285,
            0.601,
            0.303
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(15) 室温下，用 PBST 洗涤 10min，重复 4 次。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.125,
            0.307,
            0.912,
            0.367
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（16）用 AP 或者 HRP 化学发光试剂进行检测反应，根据制造商的建议在 X-ray 胶片下曝光或者用发光成像系统来检测。免疫化学发光试剂（PerkinElmer）能够达到很好的效果。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.126,
            0.378,
            0.273,
            0.401
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【注意事项】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.168,
            0.413,
            0.388,
            0.431
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "见各实验步骤注意事项。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.126,
            0.442,
            0.219,
            0.465
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【作业】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.167,
            0.477,
            0.695,
            0.495
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "请分析说明利用酵母系统表达异源基因的优点与影响因素。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.822,
            0.521,
            0.909,
            0.538
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(王宏斌)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
